          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alamdog bino dok ŋiyo gin a two tye iye-nono i ŋe lwoko. Ka en onwoŋo raŋi mere mom olokere i kan ame two tye iye-nono, kadi bed two-nono mom omedde nya, ginnono obedo gin a cik ogeŋo; obino waŋo i mac, kadi two onwoŋo oŋolo yoŋee onyo yie.",
          "type": "text",
