              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruk a two oya iye oko i kare a doŋ olwoko, kadi i uci atira onyo i uci oriye aria, onyo i ginnoro ame otio i lao, myero dok lwok tyen me aryo, eka te bedo doŋ gin a cik mom ogeŋo.”",
          "type": "text",
